Comment: 0,0:02:27.62,0:02:28.43,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HF5F4F5&\3c&H9A3AD9&}Myao
Comment: 0,0:02:32.77,0:02:34.21,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H3B2CD5&}ありえない...
Comment: 0,0:02:35.53,0:02:37.36,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}規格外
Comment: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:40.28,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}たまらない
Comment: 0,0:02:43.17,0:02:46.17,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}出会いはそう　偶然のキャットウォーク
Comment: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:49.19,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}吸い込まれる　瞳の奥 BlackHole
Comment: 0,0:02:49.58,0:02:51.24,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}ツンでデレで派手に詰んだ
Comment: 0,0:02:51.24,0:02:53.26,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}この胸の高鳴り何だ？？
Comment: 0,0:02:55.90,0:02:58.86,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}午後は雨みたいだから
Comment: 0,0:02:59.04,0:03:02.12,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}早めのランチどうかな
Comment: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:05.36,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}ばっちばちに日向ぼっこ
Comment: 0,0:03:05.36,0:03:08.36,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}なんだこの天使
Comment: 0,0:03:09.18,0:03:12.40,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}ずっと　僕は君のもんだ
Comment: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:15.48,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}最愛すぎて　時空歪んだ
Comment: 0,0:03:15.48,0:03:19.38,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}気がつけば　君こそがユニバース
Comment: 0,0:03:19.40,0:03:20.37,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}ドックンバックンで
Comment: 0,0:03:20.37,0:03:21.78,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}もはや　つらい...
Comment: 0,0:03:21.78,0:03:24.95,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}運命だって奇跡だって
Comment: 0,0:03:24.95,0:03:28.02,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}キミと出会えたのはビッグバン
Comment: 0,0:03:28.02,0:03:31.95,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}夜空に浮かぶ星はMiracle
Comment: 0,0:03:31.95,0:03:35.03,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}無償の愛にエゴはいらない
Comment: 0,0:03:35.90,0:03:38.95,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H19A20C&}ただそばにいたいんだ...
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,OPCH
Comment: 0,0:02:24.56,0:02:26.80,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HF5F4F5&\3c&H9A3AD9&}喵  喵  喵  喵  喵
Comment: 0,0:02:27.62,0:02:28.43,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HF5F4F5&\3c&H9A3AD9&}喵
Comment: 0,0:02:32.77,0:02:34.21,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H3B2CD5&}太不可思议了...
Comment: 0,0:02:35.53,0:02:37.36,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}太超模了
Comment: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:40.28,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}令人无法抗拒
Comment: 0,0:02:43.17,0:02:46.17,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}在狭窄的道路上  我们巧合地相遇了
Comment: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:49.19,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}立马就被你那黑洞一样的深邃眼神所吸引
Comment: 0,0:02:49.58,0:02:51.24,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}你的冷漠、温柔和夸张
Comment: 0,0:02:51.24,0:02:53.26,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}为何会让我心跳不已呢？？
Comment: 0,0:02:55.90,0:02:58.86,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}下午可能会下雨
Comment: 0,0:02:59.04,0:03:02.12,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}不如提前去吃午饭吧
Comment: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:05.36,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}在阳光下尽情享受着日光浴
Comment: 0,0:03:05.36,0:03:08.36,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}这小可爱到底是何方神圣
Comment: 0,0:03:09.18,0:03:12.40,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}从今往后  我都是属于你的了
Comment: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:15.48,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}过度的深爱  让时空也扭曲了
Comment: 0,0:03:15.48,0:03:19.38,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}不知不觉间  你已经成为了我的宇宙
Comment: 0,0:03:19.40,0:03:20.37,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}怦怦直跳心情
Comment: 0,0:03:20.37,0:03:21.78,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}让我倍感煎熬...
Comment: 0,0:03:21.78,0:03:24.95,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}说是命运也好  奇迹也罢
Comment: 0,0:03:24.95,0:03:28.02,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}我们的相遇就是宇宙大爆炸
Comment: 0,0:03:28.02,0:03:31.95,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}夜空中悬挂的星星就是奇迹
Comment: 0,0:03:31.95,0:03:35.03,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}纯然的爱不需要自我
Comment: 0,0:03:35.90,0:03:38.95,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H19A20C&}我只想一直陪在你的身边...
